    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d631">

                <pb facs="0800" n="706" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg706"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Rockhill to Mr.
                            Lee.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-09-05"><hi rendition="#italic">September 5,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The Department has received your dispatch
                    No. 106, of the 29th ultimo, with inclosures, relative to the fate of Charles
                    Govin, a citizen of the United States, and in reply you are instructed to press
                    unremittingly for a full investigation and a report in this matter.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. W. Rockhill</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
